  "premise": "The hollow where Morty was buried with the reel in 1933. The crows kept it for the Pumpkin King, and the pumpkins learned to grin.",
  "identity": {
    "visual": "A harvest hollow at dusk: a crooked barn, a windmill, pumpkin rows, crows on every rail.",
